Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.84,0:01:12.10,GitS 2nd Gig OP Credits,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1\fs85\c&H00FF00&}Nhanh lên nào, hãy tự do đi theo tôi.{\i0}
